The following DLG menu setup flags has been tested to work:

Enable CTRL-c breaking [y/N] => N
Enable CTRL-d breaking [y/N] => N
Enable carriage return/linefeed [Y/n] => Y
Enable echo [y/N] => N
Enable process killing [Y/n] => Y
Enable kill pending [Y/n] => Y
Enable pass-thru mode [y/N] => N
Enable pausing [y/N] => N
Enable raw mode [Y/n] => Y
Enable timeouts [Y/n] => Y
Enable verbose pause [y/N] => N
Enable line freezing [Y/n] => Y

If you are using DLG 1.0 (you should be) use the command DLG:TFlags to
set these flags.
